# Backup Rules (4 Rules)

## 18. Release Tags
Tag every release: git tag release/YYYY-MM-DD or v1.x.x. Always have rollback point.

## 19. Rollback Ready
Options: Vercel Instant Rollback or redeploy from tag.

## 20. Sanity Export
Export weekly via GitHub Actions. Before schema changes. On every release.

## 21. Single Backup Location
ALL backups in ONE S3 bucket. Retention: 4 weekly + 6 monthly.
